title: What Scarlett will want that no transcript holds.
pid: d70a02ef-828b-4a0d-92cf-e83ceaf284ab
body: |2-
  The fraction of the subscription's five-hour and weekly windows used
  is only in 'bash/claude-usage.sh' and the pacer's log, sampled before
  each pacer session; the requests file's times are what to set those
  samples against. Busy time, as against wall time, is not recorded
  per request; 'cost-state' has a run's total time in API calls.
